// Each mission card is sized to the number of maps it actually holds - 3 chips to a
// row, so a 3-map mission gets a short card and the 10-map one gets a tall card.
// Cards in a grid row share a top edge, not a height: a uniform height would leave a
// visible hole inside every short mission, and the ragged bottom edge is itself the
// information (mission 4 is the shortest in the game, and its card says so).

// ---- page: ALLIED ASSAULT   gate: !coop_protoBhide1
